# Canonical identity for the contributor graph.
#
# Four spellings of one person: the GitHub handle, the full name, a typo of the
# handle, and - after the 2026-10-02 re-authoring - the commits that had been
# recorded as authored by an assistant rather than co-authored with one. This
# maps them to a single author without rewriting anything further; git log,
# shortlog and GitHub's contributor view all honour it.
#
# Assistance is recorded where it belongs: in the Co-Authored-By trailer of the
# commits it applies to, not in the author field.
